      "updated": 1770654055506,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "6. what about node failure temporary and poermanet.\n        - hinted handoffs\n            - down healthy node keep write for this node for some time\n            - one repiar it send those data to that node.\n        - merkle tree new node addition    \n            - add nwe node replicate data to it using merkle tree. \n\n\n7. what about adition and remove of node explicitly ?     ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "6. what about node failure temporary and poermanet.\n        - hinted handoffs\n            - down healthy node keep write for this node for some time\n            - one repiar it send those data to that node.\n        - merkle tree new node addition    \n            - add nwe node replicate data to it using merkle tree. \n\n\n7. what about adition and remove of node explicitly ?     ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
