      "updated": 1770623012103,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "At node level.\nwe do have \n\n1.  bloom filter\n2. memtable  -> something like bst ( red black tree ) \n3. store sa sst tables -> sorted string \n4. backend it run compaction job. based on\n   lsm tree  ( log sorted merged ) ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "At node level.\nwe do have \n\n1.  bloom filter\n2. memtable  -> something like bst ( red black tree ) \n3. store sa sst tables -> sorted string \n4. backend it run compaction job. based on\n   lsm tree  ( log sorted merged ) ",
